The market includes products supporting speeds of 1.25Gbps and below, 1.25–10Gbps, 10–25Gbps, 25–40Gbps and 40Gbps and above.

High-speed categories are becoming increasingly important as optical networking moves toward greater bandwidth and higher transmission efficiency.

